---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="404 - 页面未找到 | APIRank"
  description="抱歉，您访问的页面不存在。"
  canonicalUrl="https://apirank.vip/zh/404/"
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-24 text-center">
    <p class="text-7xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-4">404</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">页面未找到</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">
      抱歉，您访问的页面不存在或已被移动。请检查链接，或通过下方入口继续浏览。
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 mb-12">
      <a href="/zh" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-md border border-gray-300 text-sm text-gray-700 hover:bg-blue-50 hover:border-blue-400 hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors">首页</a>
      <a href="/zh/providers" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-md border border-gray-300 text-sm text-gray-700 hover:bg-blue-50 hover:border-blue-400 hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors">全部厂商</a>
      <a href="/zh/calculator" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-md border border-gray-300 text-sm text-gray-700 hover:bg-blue-50 hover:border-blue-400 hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors">成本计算器</a>
      <a href="/zh/tutorials" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-md border border-gray-300 text-sm text-gray-700 hover:bg-blue-50 hover:border-blue-400 hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors">使用教程</a>
      <a href="/zh/about" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-md border border-gray-300 text-sm text-gray-700 hover:bg-blue-50 hover:border-blue-400 hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors">关于我们</a>
    </div>

    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
      如果您认为这是站点错误，请联系
      <a href="mailto:contact@apirank.vip" class="text-blue-600 underline">contact@apirank.vip</a>。
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>